 thrice<br>\n&lt;JoshT> weinig: when I implemented this in WebKit, did at computed value time, but i don't expect this to be a compat issue<br>\n&lt;JoshT> TabAtkins: proposed resolution is to copy linear gradients into the ??? function<br>\n&lt;JoshT> RESOLVED: Copy linear gradients timing details into the linear function<br>\n</details>\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/comments/2842523956/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]